<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="785d0f64">&lt;p&gt;
    Stakeholder analysis includes categorizing and segmenting internal and external stakeholders that will be impacted.
    This&amp;nbsp;involves working with the project team to identify for each stakeholder or group:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        degree of influence
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        degree of support
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        degree of impact
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        role in the change process
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        needs and expectations
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
